  "recordingMethod": "Manually reviewed Chromium 151 CSS-pixel capture of four isolated, source-pinned DOM replays of the checked-in moveCardBundle -> moveCard -> updateAttachedCardsPosition/decreaseCardLayer -> refreshBoard path. The legacy HTML, CSS, and cardback asset are loaded directly; application/network modules remain inert, and their relevant mutation logic is narrowly transcribed. Each branch starts from a separately reconstructed one-base/two-Energy stack. Geometry is recorded at stable pre-departure, immediate post-departure, synchronous post-refresh, and observer-settled post-refresh phases using the real empty-wrapper MutationObserver and two animation frames.",
